  "notes": [
    "Petrified Field: native result 0 sets fizzle; 1 produces mana; 2 returns the graveyard activation helper result; every other result returns zero without calling mana_producer.",
    "Implement of Improvement returns the existing aer_implement helper outside the four native activation/cleanup events; do not call it additionally on those events.",
    "Spring // Mind restores basic_spell on EVENT_CAN_CAST and retains both get_aftermath calls and the shared aftermath fallback.",
    "Inspiring Statuary keeps casting_card captured after is_token and before check_special_flags3; named event arguments denote the already-tested event.",
    "Trench Gorger retains its native four-land AI limit and zero-land effect creation; mode 8 names RESET_SUBTYPES_AT_END, not an assumed until-EOT duration.",
    "Herald of Anafenza retains its native outlast cost and white 1/1 Warrior token fields."
  ],
